issue_context.body:
### The problem

Automation to turn off HVAC (via Nexia/Trane Integration using Trane XL-824 thermostat) results in error with error message:

`The heat and cool setpoints must be at least 2 degrees different.`

Automation shuts off the heat or cooling if a window/door is already opened when the HVAC is turned on to cool or heat (from off state).

The automation executes soon after 5 minutes of being turned on while a window/door is opened except it doesnt actually turn the HVAC off and the error message results.

Automation used and trace diagonostics used are submitted below.





### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?

2022.6.6

### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?

_No response_

### What type of installation are you running?

Home Assistant OS

### Integration causing the issue

Nexia/American Standard/Trane

### Link to integration documentation on our website

https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/nexia

### Diagnostics information

[trace automation.turn_off_hvac_when_window_or_door_is_already_opened 2022-06-16T17_53_16.529357+00_00.json.txt](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/files/8921902/trace.automation.turn_off_hvac_when_window_or_door_is_already_opened.2022-06-16T17_53_16.529357%2B00_00.json.txt)


### Example YAML snippet

```yaml
alias: Turn off HVAC when window or door is already opened.
description: >-
  This will check if the Windows or Doors are closed when you turn on the heat
  or air conditioning.
trigger:
  - platform: state
    entity_id:
      - climate.house_thermostat_nativezone
    from: 'off'
    to:
      - heat
      - cool
    for:
      hours: 0
      minutes: 5
      seconds: 0
condition:
  - condition: state
    entity_id: binary_sensor.door_and_window_contacts
    state: 'on'
action:
  - variables:
      mode: >-
        {{ iif(trigger.to_state.state == "heat", "furnace", "air conditioning")
        }}
      message: >
        The ({{mode}}) turned off because a window or door is opened. Please
        close the window or door and try again.
      title: HVAC Turned Off
  - service: climate.set_hvac_mode
    data:
      hvac_mode: 'off'
    target:
      entity_id: climate.house_thermostat_nativezone
  - service: tts.cloud_say
    data:
      message: '{{message}}'
      entity_id:
        - media_player.kitchen_display
        - media_player.family_room_display
        - media_player.basement_family_room
  - service: notify.mobile_app_sony_xperia_zx1
    data:
      message: '{{message}}'
      title: '{{title}}'
  - service: notify.mobile_app_iphone
    data:
      message: '{{message}}'
      title: '{{title}}'
mode: single
```


